  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given integers N,M,KN, M, KN,M,K and NNN integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\n\nYou can perform the following operation at most KKK times:\n\n\nChoose any integer xxx such that 0≤x&lt;2M0 \\le x &lt; 2^M0≤x&lt;2M. Then, for each 1≤i≤N1 \\le i \\le N1≤i≤N, you can replace AiA_iAi​ with Ai⊕xA_i \\oplus xAi​⊕x, or leave it unchanged.\nWhat is the maximum value of A1+A2+…+ANA_1 + A_2 + \\ldots + A_NA1​+A2​+…+AN​ that you can achieve after this process?\n\n\nInput Format\nThe first line of the input contains a single integer TTT −-− the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows.\n\n\nThe first line of each test case contains three integers N,M,KN, M, KN,M,K.\n\n\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the maximum value of A1+A2+…+ANA_1 + A_2 + \\ldots + A_NA1​+A2​+…+AN​ that you can achieve.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤101 \\le T \\le 101≤T≤10",
      "1≤N≤1201 \\le N \\le 1201≤N≤120",
      "1≤M≤1201 \\le M \\le 1201≤M≤120",
      "1≤K≤51 \\le K \\le 51≤K≤5",
      "0≤Ai&lt;2M0 \\le A_i \\lt 2^M0≤Ai​&lt;2M.",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 1 (15 points):** 1≤N,M≤551 \\leq N, M \\leq 551≤N,M≤55, K=1K = 1K=1",
      "**Subtask 2 (15 points):** 1≤N,M≤551 \\leq N, M \\leq 551≤N,M≤55, K=2K = 2K=2",
      "**Subtask 3 (20 points):** 1≤N,M≤551 \\leq N, M \\leq 551≤N,M≤55, K=3K = 3K=3",
      "**Subtask 4 (40 points):** 1≤N,M≤1201 \\leq N, M \\leq 1201≤N,M≤120, K=4K = 4K=4",
      "**Subtask 5 (10 points):** 1≤N,M≤1201 \\leq N, M \\leq 1201≤N,M≤120, K=5K = 5K=5"
    ],
