        "explanation": "Explanation:\nIn the first test case, one of the possible sequences of operations is the following:\nFirst operation: Choose x=12x = 12x=12, and XOR A1,A2A_1, A_2A1​,A2​ and A3A_3A3​ with it, obtaining array [12,8,14,12][12, 8, 14, 12][12,8,14,12].\nSecond operation: Choose x=3x = 3x=3, and XOR A1,A2A_1, A_2A1​,A2​ and A4A_4A4​ with it, obtaining array [15,11,14,15][15, 11, 14, 15][15,11,14,15], with sum 555555."
      }
